  "title": "Strawberry-Rhubarb Jam",
  "description": "This strawberry-rhubarb jam is easy to make with ripe strawberries, fresh rhubarb, sugar, and pectin for a sweet breakfast spread or delicious gift.",
  "authors": [
    "Carla Bruss"
  ],
